title the word that stops and the chapter that resumes -- standfast refused for the rung marks, and the CION campaign drafted for a high-volume seat
prompt Keaton asked whether the stamp-and-name hits should be called a standfast with an expanded prompt for a high-volume model instead of the Fable 5 seat, then pressed the worry plainly: old patterns standing set a bad precedent, and molt-breach-debride exists exactly for holistic rearchitecture.
think Measured before ruling, five workflow readers in parallel. The meter: tools/w/waymark_rung_drift_witness.rish counts all 32 seated marks' digit forms in living files -- rung_marks_living=17246 under rung_ceiling=17257, ceiling falls only, any rise refuses on the lap it arrives, STOA and ALES inside its reach. The census: STOA-digit 2,076 living hits across 572 files, ALES-digit 7,196 across 510 (lotus/ 4,685); a stratified 40-hit sample classified 100 percent citation-of-landed, zero forward counters anywhere living, the only future-number lines being the five that seat the retirement law itself; filename populations 18 stoa-named living files and 30 fill-ales briefs. The chapter: CION is not waiting after Compass -- VOLS ran and is instrumented, the first LOWE sweep landed, grad_seal_witness stands GREEN, and the spec's own closing paragraph names the remainder as the wider LOWE relabel plus any word-gated OFFY cut. The law: quality-assurance.md explicitly refuses spending standfast and red vocabulary on uniformity sweeps; a red is something wrong, a ratchet something not yet uniform.
think The ruling drafted for Keaton's word: not a standfast (the seated texts refuse the word here, and spending it on uniformity blunts the word that stops the line), yet his precedent worry is real at seventeen thousand living marks -- so the answer is the chapter the tree already drew. Wrote expanding-prompts/20260829-221841_cion-resumes-the-rung-mark-molt-campaign.md, PROPOSED status, in the house sweep-prompt shape (the gauge-standfast precedent plus the mystery campaign-lane skeleton): four tiers sized from the census (18 filename molts, the 30-brief fold with 867 citers, the per-file rung-to-stamp conversion needing a derived map fixture and an open conversion-spelling ruling, and the word-gated OFFY cut), the wall (testimony untouched, no self-widening, interlocking grep-pins repaired in the same commit), close conditions (ceiling fallen, GRAD and dated-path witnesses GREEN), and the falsifier (underivable stamps fall back to the census-number ruling REDS %N already earned). Seat recommendation: a high-volume loop lane on the chatgpt-mind supervisor harness; the interactive Fable 5 bench rules and spot-grades rather than grinds.
obs QA report card at Field: composite 89, B+, stands. Register 66 (34 percent negative sentences) -- the page is mostly walls and refusals, Meter subject matter wearing Field clothes; left as graded since B or better stands and no frame pushes.
obs The earlier no-campaign lean is refined, not reversed: the grandfathered testimony ruling stands, the wall already stops new marks, and what changed is the cost side -- a loop lane makes the living-surface molt near-free, which re-weights Keaton's holistic-balance value against the reference-churn cost. The choice between them is his, which is why the page is PROPOSED.
